            <ArticleTitle>[Modification of pattern A].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>22-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Taking into account the follow-up of coronary heart disease patients from the acute phase of illness up to the social reinsertion the author proposes an approach whose goal is to modify Pattern A Behavior. Various approaches as behaviorism, dynamic psychology and psychoanalysis are complementary and have each one its importance in order to treat these &quot;serious psychosomatic patients&quot; as are coronary heart disease patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
